  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Price</strong> 1 sp (cup), 2 gp (bottle); <strong>Weight</strong> 1/2 lbs (cup), 8 lbs. (bottle)</p>\n<p>Whiskey is a distilled alcoholic beverage made from fermented grain mash (typically barley, corn, malt, rye, or wheat) aged in a wooden cask. The longer the drink ages in the cask, the smoother the final product. Each bottle contains upto 17 servings of whiskey, usually referred to as a shot or jigger.</p>\n<hr>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/adventuring-gear#toc37\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
